  "details": "Description\n\nFor the last month seemingly, I have been unable to view most players avatars. The robot will show instead and will not load despite my settings allowing all avatars to be shown regardless of friend status. In terms of worlds, I will consistently run into an issue where I will attempt to join a world with a friend only to be kicked out of the loading screen and sent back to the Home World. Recently it seems to at least let me in after a couple of tries, however it isn't consistent enough to be enjoyable. I do not  know how to fix this and almost every thread about this issue comes from 2022/2023. \n\nReproduction Steps\n\nThe one workaround I have is constantly turning avatars off and on until it works. Yet once it works, if the Player swaps avatars the robot returns. Pretty much the same with worlds, just have to constantly join until I am fully put into the loading screen.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3p2-1921-15c4a824b2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-14_11-20-48.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_5bb28fb6-ca63-47cb-8211-5ec61955ef9b/1/file)",
